{"header":"<h1>Module type <code><span>Stateful.State_machine</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":false,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"hegel","href":"../../../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"Hegel","href":"../../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Stateful","href":"../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"State_machine","href":"#","kind":"module-type"}],"toc":[],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"<p>A sequential state machine.</p><pre class=\"language-ocaml\"><code>module Counter : Stateful.State_machine with type state = int ref = struct\u000A  type state = int ref\u000A\u000A  let add tc n =\u000A    n := !n + draw ~label:&quot;by&quot; tc (integers ~min_value:1 ~max_value:10 ())\u000A  ;;\u000A\u000A  let rules = [ Stateful.Rule.create ~name:&quot;add&quot; ~step:add () ]\u000A\u000A  let invariants =\u000A    [ Stateful.Invariant.create ~name:&quot;small&quot; ~inv:(fun _tc n -&gt; assert (!n &lt; 100)) ()\u000A    ]\u000A  ;;\u000Aend</code></pre>","content":"<div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-state\"><a href=\"#type-state\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> state</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-rules\"><a href=\"#val-rules\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> rules : <span><span><a href=\"#type-state\">state</a> <a href=\"../Rule/index.html#type-t\">Rule.t</a></span> list</span></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-invariants\"><a href=\"#val-invariants\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> invariants : <span><span><a href=\"#type-state\">state</a> <a href=\"../Invariant/index.html#type-t\">Invariant.t</a></span> list</span></span></code></div></div>"}